      "content": "That's a decent start, pretty clear. But I noticed the score on this one was actually kind of low—only one of those \"trigger\" words showed up. \n\nCan you try expanding on the stages a bit more? I want to make sure the students really get it. Just try to make the explanation a bit more \"instructional\" and engaging for them so the system ranks it higher, but again, please keep it natural. Don't make it weird or repetitive.",
